# Research provenance hashes exact bytes, not newline-normalized text.
# Disable Git's implicit clean/smudge EOL conversion, including core.autocrlf.
# LF, CRLF, mixed text and binary evidence must round-trip byte for byte.
# New text is written explicitly as UTF-8/LF by its author or generator.
* -text

# Frozen compatibility volume: retain its historical LF Git blob and CRLF
# working bytes. This explicit exception is independent of the host OS.
CATALOG.md text eol=crlf
